Changes in this fork, Copyright (c) 2026 Daniel:

  - plugin id siam.ticktick -> dddaniel1.dida365; display name "Dida 365"
    (manifest.json, qml/BarWidget.qml moduleName and ipcTarget, docs, tests)
  - API default host -> api.dida365.com (Dida365); the international host is kept
    reachable as api.INTL_BASE, and an existing sign-in's stored api_base still wins
  - OAuth endpoints and the developer-console link now derive from the service a
    sign-in targets (api.site_domain, auth.oauth_urls, auth.developer_console), so the
    browser flow cannot open the wrong service's app roster
  - authorize() takes api_base and records it, keeping the token and the host it was
    minted against paired; `ticktick auth` gained --api-base to match `ticktick login`
  - tests/test_services.py (12 tests) covering the service split
  - the workspace: WORKSPACE.md, COMPARISON.md, AGENTS.md, and the sources/ trees

